<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 11.07bln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 11.07bln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had accepted 11.07 billion rupees in an open market operation on Thursday in short-term federal bonds.</p>
<p>Figures in brackets show results of the previous operation on November 27.</p>
<p>		     Offered	 Accepted	Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sales  11.18 (6.085) 10.97 (5.32)  15.00 pct/yr (15.00)</p>
<p>Five-month repo   nil	     nil		nil</p>
<p>Three-month repo 0.10 (0.30)    0.10 (0.30) 14.00 (14.00)</p>
<p>One-month repo    nil	     nil		nil</p>
<p>Total(bln rupees)11.280	  11.070</p>
</text>
